[ti:Paper Lanterns]
[ar:The Quiet Hours]
[00:30.00]the porch light burning low
[00:36.00]so you could find the way back home
[00:41.00]the river hums a borrowed tune
[00:46.00]and every window holds the moon
[00:52.00]
[00:55.00](hold on, hold on)
[01:00.00]paper lanterns in the rain
